tyle=\"vertical-align: -0.464ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.348ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 596 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D719\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D719\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the phase constant. The wave velocity <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.097ex\" height=\"1.027ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -443 485 454\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is related to the wave number and angular frequency by the formula:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.105ex\" height=\"2.398ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -707.2 2698.4 1060\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(762.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1818.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D714\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D714\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(255.7,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><rect width=\"639.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Comparing the given equation with the general equation, we can see that:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.938ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3950.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1027.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2083.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(2583.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2750.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">cm</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.675ex\" height=\"2.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -948 6486.2 1148\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(798.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1854.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink